::  modules/harness/glow/fold-harness-wood.glow -- WOOD Harness Ledger!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-harness-wood-split
  |=  [wood=@ud permille=@ud hit=@ud]                   ::  ==1000 & 0 on hit
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified wood
  ~|  'harness-wood-permille-or-cache-hit-breach'       ::  conserved WOOD
  ?>  &(eql(permille 1000) |(eql(hit 0) eql(wood 0)))
  wood
--
